{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/TWISTED_WEAPONS.gif?t=1740132035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Nine deadly weapons with one thing in common\u2013 they all fire backward. Mastering each weapon's quirks is the key to combat. Jet around with the flamethrower, master the kick of the shotgun, kill at a distance with the sniper rifle. Whatever you choose-\u00a0 fire with purpose, or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/NIGHTMARISH_ENEMIES.gif?t=1740132035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They crawl, lunge, and swarm\u2013 grotesque enemies and their sinister overlords. Learn their patterns and perfect your positioning for maximum carnage. Fail and be pulled into madness. They don\u2019t want to kill you\u2013 they want to keep you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/A_TERRIBLE_PRICE.gif?t=1740132035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each descent is a fleeting ten-minutes of chaos. The souls you collect... are eternal. Use them to unlock powerful upgrades for your ship, evolving your arsenal and abilities. Die, upgrade, repeat\u2014come back stronger, or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392590?t=1740132035","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392590?t=1740132035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/53d0d658a71697e1544b276c6703486d55e3fe13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740132035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/53d0d658a71697e1544b276c6703486d55e3fe13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740132035","c